{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"40":"Prescribed Punishments (Kitab Al-Hudud)"},"section_detail":{"40":{"hadithnumber_first":4351,"hadithnumber_last":4493,"arabicnumber_first":4351,"arabicnumber_last":4493,"name_native":"كتاب الحدود"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4378,"arabicnumber":4378,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن عبيد، حدثنا حماد بن زيد، حدثنا يحيى، عن ابن المنكدر، ان هزالا، امر ماعزا ان ياتي النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم فيخبره","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":40,"hadith":28}}]}